      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "人口（じんこう）二十五万四千八百七十七人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total population: 254,877 persons. CORRECTION: MASTER records 254,867 (reading 八百六拾七); at 9x the disputed digit is unambiguously 七 (horizontal stroke crossed by a hooked vertical), not 六 (which carries a top lid 亠 and splaying legs). The printed male+female split, 129,374 + 125,503, sums to exactly 254,877, confirming the scan against MASTER. MASTER's 貳 is also a normalisation: the scan prints plain 二 (two thin horizontal strokes)."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "人口"
      }
    ],
