      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Female: 125,503 persons, of the 254,877 total; the left-hand half-column of the split. CORRECTION: MASTER records 125,531. The scan reads 五千五百三人 with no 十一 — the female run is 10 glyphs against the male's 12, and it terminates with 人 at y2857-2900 while the male column runs on to 四人 at y2992-3038. 129,374 + 125,503 = 254,877 reproduces the printed total exactly, whereas MASTER's figures sum to 254,905 and match neither its own total nor the scan."
      },
