        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（外）神社（じんじゃ）四百六十五ヶ所　社人（しゃにん）二千四十七人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Additionally (外), shrines: 465 places, with 2,047 shrine personnel (shanin). CORRECTION: MASTER's transcription of this row (社人二千四百四十七人 男千七百三十六人 女三百九十一人) is wrong on all three figures — the run between 二千 and 人 is only THREE glyphs (四/十/七), not the five (四/百/四/十/七) that 2,447 would require. MASTER's own separate 社人 男/女 rows (1,016 and 1,031) sum to 2,047 and match the scan, so MASTER is internally inconsistent here and its M/F values for this row appear to have been imported from another entry."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "（外）神社"
      }
